शि॑शिर m. n. the cool or dewy season, i.g. hoar, frost,
dew;
 as adj. cool, chilly.

शिष् शिन॑ष्टि शिंषति pp. शिष्ट॑ (q.v.) leave;
 P.
शिष्यते be left, remain, w. न want, be missing. C. शेषयति, ˚ते
leave, spare. — अति leave remaining;
 P. remain. अप leave out.
अव leave remaining (also C.);
 P. be left, remain. ऊद् & परि the
same. वि leave apart i.e. separate, distinguish, characterize. P. be
distinguished by (instr.), differ from (abl.);
 be eminent among (gen. or
loc.), be better or more excellent than (abl. or instr.). C.
distinguish, characterize;
 pick out, prefer;
 exceed, surpass (acc.).
प्रवि increase, augment. — Cf. अ॑तिशिष्ट, अवशिष्ट, उ॑च्छिष्ट,
प॑रिशिष्ट (sic!), वि॑शिष्ट, स॑शिष्ट.

